# worker-settlement only. Leave empty for LAUNCH_TIER=minimal (no credits program: nothing to sign for).
# The settlement authority recorded in trellis_credits (MAINNET_SETTLEMENT_AUTHORITY) and the
# sale authority of trellis_capacity: commits the hourly spent roots, pays closure refunds and settles hosts.
# A base58 64-byte ed25519 secret key. No other signing key may be in this file.
SETTLEMENT_PRIVATE_KEY=
